==Battleground==
*The enemy base here is a [[Moai Statue (Enemy Base)|Moai Statue]].
*2 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 20~30 seconds<sup>600f~900f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 26.67~40 seconds<sup>800f~1,200f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Shadow Boxer K]]s spawn after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>, delay 66.67~80 seconds<sup>2,000f~2,400f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 75% HP:
**Infinite [[Doge Dark]]s spawn, delay 33.33~50 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,500f</sup>.
**2 [[Easter B.B.Bunny|Easter B.B.Bunnies]] spawn, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
**1 [[Easter Duche]] spawns.
*When the base reaches 50% HP:
**4 [[Easter B.B.Bunny|Easter B.B.Bunnies]] spawn, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
**2 [[Easter Duche]]s spawn, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.

